---
title: Norwegian Drop Cookies
author: Grandma Gustad
category: Cookies
cook time: 15-18 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@shortening{1%cup}
@eggs{3}
@cinnamon{1%tsp}
@cloves{1%tsp}
@raisins{1%cup}
@brown sugar{2%cups}
@flour{2%cups}
@nutmeg{1%tsp}
@baking soda{1%tsp}
@chopped nuts

Drop onto greased cookie sheet and bake at 350 degrees for about 15-18 minutes.
